{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "title": "Release review reference matrix",
  "policy": [
    "These user-supplied prompts are review inputs, not proof of AI authorship, universal requirements, fixed fines or legal advice.",
    "Preserve the project brief, deliberate brand decisions and useful behavior. Do not add analytics, FAQs, maps, team photos, invented metrics or testimonials to satisfy a generic list.",
    "Each row starts not_assessed with unresolved applicability and no evidence. Static findings, completed commands and documentation do not establish a passed customer journey or live security configuration.",
    "Record applicability with a reason, current source revision, observation, consequence, repair and recheck evidence. Keep unknown, blocked and not-applicable outcomes distinct.",
    "Do not rewrite shared Git history or rotate credentials automatically. Remove source exposure, identify affected credentials privately and coordinate rotation and history cleanup through the owner."
  ],
